Temporary canary trigger file (Cameron-approved 2026-08-13).

Pushing this file fires the N=1 batch-2 ingestion canary via the temporary
push trigger in .github/workflows/ingest-chunk.yml (push-triggered runs have
no inputs and therefore default to chunk_size 1 / no re-dispatch). The first
run registers the workflow with GitHub, which unblocks dispatch-by-filename
for the trampoline, the chain's self-re-dispatch, and the Actions-tab
Run-workflow button.

This file and the push trigger are deleted immediately after the canary is
verified.
